# The members of enums, by their texts and in their order (see docs/reference/std.md#stdenums).

## The interface of the enums, which bounds type parameters, as `<E: Enum>`.
# The compiler tells the types that satisfy it, which are the enums.
export interface Enum
  to_string: () -> String
  equals: (Self) -> Bool

## `parse<E>(text)`: the member of E whose text is the String, or nil.
export intrinsic parse

## `members<E>()`: the members of E as declared.
export intrinsic members
